Dear Brandon,

thank you so, so much! I just started using R and I'm still having a hard time.
I do have one question. I'm not sure if the script includes it, but the idea of the model is that A+B is the input/independent, C+D the mediators, and E+F dependent/outcome.

So the hypothesis would be

D mediates the relationship between B and E
D mediates the relationship between A and E
C mediates the relationship between B and E
C mediates the relationship between A and E
D mediates the relationship between B and F
D mediates the relationship between A and F
C mediates the relationship between B and F
C mediates the relationship between A and F
Thank you so much!

