From u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com  Fri Jun 12 09:14:51 2020
From: u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com (Terrence Jorgensen)
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2020 09:14:51 +0000
Subject: Re: Questions about measurement invariance, cfa, sem and latent growth.
Message-ID: <N92pCOrK_b4.BGMYNLqMBQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <N92pCOrK_b4.lGFlj3wbBQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
References: <N92pCOrK_b4.lGFlj3wbBQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
